{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（庚戌、前一三一）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（庚戌、前一三一）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f87220b-db0e-11ef-b6d3-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"魏其侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏其侯","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8f87220e-db0e-11ef-b902-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武安侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"武安侯","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8f87220f-db0e-11ef-a3c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8f872210-db0e-11ef-9c18-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班固","people_name_jianti_auto":"班固","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8f872211-db0e-11ef-a6b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"竇嬰","people_name_jianti_auto":"窦婴","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"8f872212-db0e-11ef-994f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"田蚡","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8f872213-db0e-11ef-b01a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嬰","people_name_jianti_auto":"婴","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8f872214-db0e-11ef-ae9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班固","people_name_jianti_auto":"班固","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"8f872215-db0e-11ef-9992-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f872216-db0e-11ef-9611-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渭城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城县","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8f872217-db0e-11ef-8731-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8f872218-db0e-11ef-aaf6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8f872219-db0e-11ef-862c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8f87221a-db0e-11ef-8b1d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢法，以冬月行重刑，遇春則赦若贖，故以十二月晦論殺魏其侯。此武安侯蚡之意也。渭城縣屬扶風，秦之咸陽也。考異曰：班固漢武故事曰：「上召大臣議之。羣臣多是竇嬰，上亦不復窮問，兩罷之。田蚡大恨，欲自殺；先與太后訣，兄弟共號哭訴太后，太后亦哭，弗食。上不得已，遂乃殺嬰。」按漢武故事，語多誕妄，非班固書；蓋後人爲之，託固名耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉法，以冬月行重刑，遇春则赦若赎，故以十二月晦论杀魏其侯。此武安侯蚡之意也。渭城县属扶风，秦之咸阳也。考异曰：班固汉武故事曰：「上召大臣议之。群臣多是窦婴，上亦不复穷问，两罢之。田蚡大恨，欲自杀；先与太后诀，兄弟共号哭诉太后，太后亦哭，弗食。上不得已，遂乃杀婴。」按汉武故事，语多诞妄，非班固书；盖后人为之，托固名耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f87220d-db0e-11ef-be7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"灌夫","people_name_jianti_auto":"灌夫","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8f87221f-db0e-11ef-a3ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"灌夫","people_name_jianti_auto":"灌夫","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8f872220-db0e-11ef-96be-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏其","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏其","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8f872221-db0e-11ef-8466-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"徐廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐广","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8f872222-db0e-11ef-8ca6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"8f872223-db0e-11ef-bf02-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嬰","people_name_jianti_auto":"婴","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"8f872224-db0e-11ef-9aa0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"广","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"8f872225-db0e-11ef-8f14-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"8f872226-db0e-11ef-b570-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏其","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏其","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"8f872227-db0e-11ef-a84b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"8f872228-db0e-11ef-a2cb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：武安侯傳云：「元光四年春，丞相按灌夫事；其夏，取夫人。五年十月，論灌夫及家屬。十二月，晦，魏其棄市。」徐廣引武帝本紀、侯表，以爲蚡薨在嬰死後分明，四年當是三年，五年當是四年。今從之。廣又疑十二月爲二月；按漢制，常以立春下寬大詔書，蚡恐魏其得釋，故以十二月晦殺之，何必改爲二月也！","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：武安侯传云：「元光四年春，丞相按灌夫事；其夏，取夫人。五年十月，论灌夫及家属。十二月，晦，魏其弃市。」徐广引武帝本纪、侯表，以为蚡薨在婴死后分明，四年当是三年，五年当是四年。今从之。广又疑十二月为二月；按汉制，常以立春下宽大诏书，蚡恐魏其得释，故以十二月晦杀之，何必改为二月也！","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8f87221e-db0e-11ef-a3c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_reference","source_end_index":9,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"見後十九卷元狩元年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8fba3aa3-db0e-11ef-9be9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見後十九卷元狩元年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见后十九卷元狩元年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8f87222d-db0e-11ef-a098-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":7,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"見上卷建元二年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8f56b2ad-db0e-11ef-a2ac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見上卷建元二年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见上卷建元二年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8f87222e-db0e-11ef-b29e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-131,"link_td_description":"窦婴，清河郡觀津縣（今河北省衡水市武邑县）人，西汉政治人物，是汉文帝皇后窦氏堂兄之子，以军功封魏其侯，后因与武安侯田蚡不和，被以「伪造诏书罪」斩首。","link_td_id":"Q10000764","link_td_number_id":358768,"people_name":"魏其","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏其","people_xingming":"窦婴","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8f87222f-db0e-11ef-a1fc-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[窦婴]"},{"link_death_year":-130,"link_td_description":"田蚡，内史长陵（今陕西咸阳市东北）人，西汉政治人物。汉武帝的舅舅、大臣，封武安侯。后来与魏其侯窦婴不和，设计杀害灌夫及窦婴，窦婴死后，田蚡亦发疯而亡。《史记》中说，占卜师分析田蚡是因为窦婴和灌夫两鬼的灵魂缠身而死亡。","link_td_id":"Q10008552","link_td_number_id":325827,"people_name":"武安侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"武安侯","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8f872231-db0e-11ef-8b6b-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田蚡]"},{"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8f872232-db0e-11ef-a7b3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-179,"link_death_year":-122,"link_td_description":"刘安，汉高祖刘邦之孙，淮南王刘长之子，西汉淮南王，现留名著《淮南子》，是古代科学思想的总合代表著作。","link_td_id":"Q10000908","link_td_number_id":433673,"people_name":"淮南王","people_name_jianti_auto":"淮南王","people_xingming":"刘安","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8f872233-db0e-11ef-8afb-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-179,"link_death_year":-122,"link_td_description":"刘安，汉高祖刘邦之孙，淮南王刘长之子，西汉淮南王，现留名著《淮南子》，是古代科学思想的总合代表著作。","link_td_id":"Q10000908","link_td_number_id":433673,"people_name":"安","people_name_jianti_auto":"安","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8f872234-db0e-11ef-af08-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-130,"link_td_description":"田蚡，内史长陵（今陕西咸阳市东北）人，西汉政治人物。汉武帝的舅舅、大臣，封武安侯。后来与魏其侯窦婴不和，设计杀害灌夫及窦婴，窦婴死后，田蚡亦发疯而亡。《史记》中说，占卜师分析田蚡是因为窦婴和灌夫两鬼的灵魂缠身而死亡。","link_td_id":"Q10008552","link_td_number_id":325827,"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","people_xingming":"田蚡","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8f872235-db0e-11ef-bfea-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-179,"link_death_year":-122,"link_td_description":"刘安，汉高祖刘邦之孙，淮南王刘长之子，西汉淮南王，现留名著《淮南子》，是古代科学思想的总合代表著作。","link_td_id":"Q10000908","link_td_number_id":433673,"people_name":"安","people_name_jianti_auto":"安","people_xingming":"刘安","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8f872236-db0e-11ef-b5bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-130,"link_td_description":"田蚡，内史长陵（今陕西咸阳市东北）人，西汉政治人物。汉武帝的舅舅、大臣，封武安侯。后来与魏其侯窦婴不和，设计杀害灌夫及窦婴，窦婴死后，田蚡亦发疯而亡。《史记》中说，占卜师分析田蚡是因为窦婴和灌夫两鬼的灵魂缠身而死亡。","link_td_id":"Q10008552","link_td_number_id":325827,"people_name":"武安侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"武安侯","people_xingming":"田蚡","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8f872237-db0e-11ef-a483-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田蚡]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","place_note":"陝西咸陽","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f872230-db0e-11ef-9ac7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉母后","excerpts":[{"context_after":"韩嫣得幸于上，江都王为太后泣，请得入宿卫比嫣，后繇此衔嫣...","context_before":"...东宫，后大怒，求得二人奸利事以责上，上下绾、臧吏，杀之。","source_end_index":294,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9be3ffd2-3469-42c6-8678-33be0f520187","source_start_index":241,"source_text":"窦婴、田蚡廷辩，王太后大怒不食，曰：“我在也，而人皆藉吾弟，且帝宁能为石人邪！”帝不直蚡，特为太后故杀婴。"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/汉母后","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉武帝田蚡公孙弘","excerpts":[{"context_after":"；于公孙弘则云性意忌，外宽内深，饰诈钓名，不为贤大夫所称...","context_before":"...奢极侈，置生民于涂炭；于田蚡则诋其负贵骄溢，以肺腑为相，","source_end_index":60,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c0382e57-bfaa-49df-8f96-9de1acd71461","source_start_index":54,"source_text":"杀窦婴、灌夫"}],"path":"五笔/卷四/汉武帝田蚡公孙弘","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["权争"],"content":"1冬，十二月晦，論殺魏其於渭城。春，三月，乙卯，武安侯蚡亦薨。及淮南王安敗，上聞蚡受安金，有不順語，曰：「使武安侯在者，族矣！」","content_fanyi":"冬季十二月的最后一天，魏其侯窦婴在渭城被按所定罪状处死。春季三月乙卯日，武安侯田蚡也去世了。等到淮南王刘安谋反事败后，武帝得知田蚡曾接受刘安的黄金，还说过悖逆犯上的话，于是说：“假使武安侯还活着，就要灭他的族了！”","content_jianti_auto":"1冬，十二月晦，论杀魏其于渭城。春，三月，乙卯，武安侯蚡亦薨。及淮南王安败，上闻蚡受安金，有不顺语，曰：「使武安侯在者，族矣！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1437,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":2,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f87220c-db0e-11ef-8e6b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2夏，四月，隕霜殺草。","content_fanyi":"夏季四月，降下霜冻，冻死了野草。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，四月，陨霜杀草。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1438,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8f872238-db0e-11ef-871e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"如淳","people_name_jianti_auto":"如淳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f87223b-db0e-11ef-ae46-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"安国","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8f87223c-db0e-11ef-9335-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8f87223d-db0e-11ef-9a7c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"如淳曰：爲天子導引而墮車蹇跛也。余據漢制，大駕則公卿奉引，安國蓋因奉引而墮車也。墮，杜火翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"如淳曰：为天子导引而堕车蹇跛也。余据汉制，大驾则公卿奉引，安国盖因奉引而堕车也。堕，杜火翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8f87223a-db0e-11ef-94e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"薛澤","people_name_jianti_auto":"薛泽","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f87223f-db0e-11ef-b3bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f872240-db0e-11ef-b154-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"廣平侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"广平侯","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f872241-db0e-11ef-a54f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"薛歐","people_name_jianti_auto":"薛欧","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8f872242-db0e-11ef-9fed-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8f872243-db0e-11ef-a57f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"澤","people_name_jianti_auto":"泽","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8f872244-db0e-11ef-9a99-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"平棘侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"平棘侯","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8f872245-db0e-11ef-9801-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8f872246-db0e-11ef-b64c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"廣平","place_name_jianti_auto":"广平","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8f872247-db0e-11ef-973f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平棘縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"平棘县","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8f872248-db0e-11ef-9de5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"常山郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"常山郡","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8f872249-db0e-11ef-bdcf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"薛澤，高祖功臣廣平侯薛歐之孫。廣平，侯國，景帝中二年罪絕；中五年，復封澤平棘侯。班志，平棘縣屬常山郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"薛泽，高祖功臣广平侯薛欧之孙。广平，侯国，景帝中二年罪绝；中五年，复封泽平棘侯。班志，平棘县属常山郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8f87223e-db0e-11ef-a91d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史大夫","official_note":"御史大夫是秦汉时期的高级官职，负责监察百官，位列三公之一。在《资治通鉴》此段中，御史大夫韩安国（安國）代理丞相职务，体现了其在中央政权中的重要地位。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"御史大夫安國行丞相事","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"1b7cdbfb-efb8-400a-b9e6-3832f004ddef"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"丞相","official_note":"丞相是秦汉时期的最高行政长官，总揽朝政。在此段中，韩安国（安國）以御史大夫身份代理丞相职责，后因病免职，由薛澤接任，反映了丞相职位的更迭。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"御史大夫安國行丞相事","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"370fc9bb-bab2-43a7-b32a-c01fd013252c"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"丞相","official_note":"丞相是秦汉时期的最高行政长官，总揽朝政。在此段中，薛澤被任命为丞相，接替因病免职的韩安国，显示了朝廷人事变动。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"以平棘侯薛澤爲丞相","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"37cd6506-860b-4391-bbfc-a69c7cc639fc"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-127,"link_td_description":"韩安国，字长孺。西汉大臣，官至御史大夫。曾为梁孝王幕僚，并且是梁孝王身边得力谋士。后来深得汉景帝的信任，化解了汉廷中央和梁孝王的关系，汉武帝时，提倡和亲匈奴，西汉北部边疆多年无战事。元朔二年（公元前127年），因病去世。","link_td_id":"Q10002155","link_td_number_id":1132992,"people_name":"安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"安国","people_xingming":"韩安国","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8f87224b-db0e-11ef-b608-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"薛泽，西汉丞相。汉高祖功臣广平侯薛欧之孙，薛泽为平棘侯，谥节。前131年，田蚡死后，他为丞相，他担任八年丞相，其权力被汉武帝的中朝架空。前124年，薛泽免官，公孙弘为丞相。","link_td_id":"Q10012625","link_td_number_id":1492347,"people_name":"平棘侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"平棘侯","people_xingming":"薛泽","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8f87224c-db0e-11ef-9c3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"薛泽，西汉丞相。汉高祖功臣广平侯薛欧之孙，薛泽为平棘侯，谥节。前131年，田蚡死后，他为丞相，他担任八年丞相，其权力被汉武帝的中朝架空。前124年，薛泽免官，公孙弘为丞相。","link_td_id":"Q10012625","link_td_number_id":1492347,"people_name":"薛澤","people_name_jianti_auto":"薛泽","people_xingming":"薛泽","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8f87224d-db0e-11ef-be39-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-127,"link_td_description":"韩安国，字长孺。西汉大臣，官至御史大夫。曾为梁孝王幕僚，并且是梁孝王身边得力谋士。后来深得汉景帝的信任，化解了汉廷中央和梁孝王的关系，汉武帝时，提倡和亲匈奴，西汉北部边疆多年无战事。元朔二年（公元前127年），因病去世。","link_td_id":"Q10002155","link_td_number_id":1132992,"people_name":"安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"安国","people_xingming":"韩安国","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8f87224e-db0e-11ef-a2a0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3御史大夫安國行丞相事，引，墮車，蹇。五月，丁巳，以平棘侯薛澤爲丞相；安國病免。","content_fanyi":"御史大夫韩安国代理丞相职事，在替汉武帝引导车驾时从车上跌落，成了跛脚。五月丁巳日，汉武帝任命平棘侯薛泽为丞相；韩安国因病免职。","content_jianti_auto":"3御史大夫安国行丞相事，引，堕车，蹇。五月，丁巳，以平棘侯薛泽为丞相；安国病免。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1439,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8f872239-db0e-11ef-9155-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4地震；赦天下。","content_fanyi":"四年，发生地震；大赦天下。","content_jianti_auto":"4地震；赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1440,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f87224f-db0e-11ef-934e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"中尉","official_note":"中尉在汉代负责京师的治安和军事，此处张欧担任此职，后升为御史大夫。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以中尉張歐爲御史大夫","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"514580eb-9644-4bd5-b569-87ea3b657add"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史大夫","official_note":"御史大夫是汉代三公之一，掌管监察和弹劾，此处张欧从中尉升任此职。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以中尉張歐爲御史大夫","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"3d9e3ab8-68f7-436a-9524-ff8b96c537aa"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"中尉","official_note":"中尉在汉代负责京师的治安和军事，此处韩安国病愈后重新担任此职。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"韓安國疾愈，復爲中尉","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"0fa5769d-1aa3-4294-9272-fd04053e4a6d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"张欧，又名张叔，西汉大臣，汉高祖功臣安丘侯张说之子。汉文帝时，以治刑名侍奉太子刘启。汉景帝时，深受尊重，为九卿太常。汉武帝元光四年，替代韩安国为御史大夫，治狱谨慎。五年后因病告老，居家而终。","link_td_id":"Q10002666","link_td_number_id":1492322,"people_name":"張歐","people_name_jianti_auto":"张欧","people_xingming":"张欧","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f872251-db0e-11ef-ba1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-127,"link_td_description":"韩安国，字长孺。西汉大臣，官至御史大夫。曾为梁孝王幕僚，并且是梁孝王身边得力谋士。后来深得汉景帝的信任，化解了汉廷中央和梁孝王的关系，汉武帝时，提倡和亲匈奴，西汉北部边疆多年无战事。元朔二年（公元前127年），因病去世。","link_td_id":"Q10002155","link_td_number_id":1132992,"people_name":"韓安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩安国","people_xingming":"韩安国","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8f872252-db0e-11ef-ac88-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"5九月，以中尉張歐爲御史大夫。韓安國疾愈，復爲中尉。","content_fanyi":"九月，武帝将中尉张欧任命为御史大夫。韩安国病愈后，重新担任中尉。","content_jianti_auto":"5九月，以中尉张欧为御史大夫。韩安国疾愈，复为中尉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1441,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f872250-db0e-11ef-89e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"德","people_name_jianti_auto":"德","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f872255-db0e-11ef-b819-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8f872256-db0e-11ef-9e73-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8f872257-db0e-11ef-9333-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8f872258-db0e-11ef-a8d0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"德，景帝子，帝之兄也；景帝前二年受封。師古曰：實事求是，務得其實，每求眞是也。好，呼到翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"德，景帝子，帝之兄也；景帝前二年受封。师古曰：实事求是，务得其实，每求真是也。好，呼到翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f872254-db0e-11ef-bcd4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朝，直遙翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朝，直遥翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8f872259-db0e-11ef-973c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f87225b-db0e-11ef-8452-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"先秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"先秦","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f87225c-db0e-11ef-87e5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8f87225d-db0e-11ef-870f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：先秦，猶言秦先，謂未焚書之前。余據獻王傳，舊書，卽謂周官、尚書、禮記、孟子、老子之書也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：先秦，犹言秦先，谓未焚书之前。余据献王传，旧书，即谓周官、尚书、礼记、孟子、老子之书也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8f87225a-db0e-11ef-89db-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f872265-db0e-11ef-8049-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：被服，言常居處其中也。造次，謂所向必行也。余謂被服者，言以儒術衣被其身也。被，皮義翻。造，千到翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：被服，言常居处其中也。造次，谓所向必行也。余谓被服者，言以儒术衣被其身也。被，皮义翻。造，千到翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"8f872264-db0e-11ef-970b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河間王","official_note":"河間王是漢朝分封的諸侯王，掌管河間地區，此處指劉德，他在文中以好學著稱，招求書籍，體現其文化角色。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"河間王德","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9b89b79a-f8d5-4c17-ae0c-1d37965ffefc"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"淮南王","official_note":"淮南王是漢朝分封的諸侯王，掌管淮南地區，此處指劉安，他在文中以好書和浮辯著稱，與河間王形成對比。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"淮南王安","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"bb4e03c6-7395-4c2f-86c9-13a79a81b60e"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-171,"link_death_year":-129,"link_td_description":"刘德，西汉宗室，封河间（今河北省河间市一带）王，谥献，是为河间献王。","link_td_id":"Q10002475","link_td_number_id":1091440,"people_name":"河間王","people_name_jianti_auto":"河间王","people_xingming":"刘德","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8f872266-db0e-11ef-b584-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-171,"link_death_year":-129,"link_td_description":"刘德，西汉宗室，封河间（今河北省河间市一带）王，谥献，是为河间献王。","link_td_id":"Q10002475","link_td_number_id":1091440,"people_name":"德","people_name_jianti_auto":"德","people_xingming":"刘德","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f872267-db0e-11ef-8d3d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-179,"link_death_year":-122,"link_td_description":"刘安，汉高祖刘邦之孙，淮南王刘长之子，西汉淮南王，现留名著《淮南子》，是古代科学思想的总合代表著作。","link_td_id":"Q10000908","link_td_number_id":433673,"people_name":"淮南王","people_name_jianti_auto":"淮南王","people_xingming":"刘安","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8f872269-db0e-11ef-9a46-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-179,"link_death_year":-122,"link_td_description":"刘安，汉高祖刘邦之孙，淮南王刘长之子，西汉淮南王，现留名著《淮南子》，是古代科学思想的总合代表著作。","link_td_id":"Q10000908","link_td_number_id":433673,"people_name":"安","people_name_jianti_auto":"安","people_xingming":"刘安","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8f87226a-db0e-11ef-9711-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-171,"link_death_year":-129,"link_td_description":"刘德，西汉宗室，封河间（今河北省河间市一带）王，谥献，是为河间献王。","link_td_id":"Q10002475","link_td_number_id":1091440,"people_name":"獻王","people_name_jianti_auto":"献王","people_xingming":"刘德","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8f87226b-db0e-11ef-8209-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘德]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢朝","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉朝","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8f872268-db0e-11ef-8dff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"先秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"先秦","resolved_place_entity_id":5917,"start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8f87226c-db0e-11ef-9ab3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"山","place_name_jianti_auto":"山","resolved_place_entity_id":1386,"start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8f87226d-db0e-11ef-81ff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6河間王德，脩學好古，實事求是，以金帛招求四方善書，得書多與漢朝等。是時，淮南王安亦好書，所招致率多浮辯；獻王所得書，皆古文先秦舊書，采禮樂古事，稍稍增輯至五百餘篇，被服、造次必於儒者，山東諸儒多從之遊。","content_fanyi":"河间王刘德，修习学问，喜好古学，治学讲求实事求是，用黄金、丝帛征求天下各地的好书，得到的书籍数量与汉朝朝廷的藏书大致相当。当时，淮南王刘安也喜好书籍，但他招来的书大多是浮华巧辩一类；河间献王所得到的书，都是用古文字写成的先秦旧书，他采集礼乐方面的古代事迹，逐渐加以增补编辑，达到五百多篇，衣着穿戴、仓促之际必定合乎儒者规范，崤山以东的儒生大多跟随他交游。","content_jianti_auto":"6河间王德，修学好古，实事求是，以金帛招求四方善书，得书多与汉朝等。是时，淮南王安亦好书，所招致率多浮辩；献王所得书，皆古文先秦旧书，采礼乐古事，稍稍增辑至五百余篇，被服、造次必于儒者，山东诸儒多从之游。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1442,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8f872253-db0e-11ef-9708-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"四年","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8f87220a-db0e-11ef-b74a-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（庚戌、前一三一）","year_int":-131},"message":"success","success":true}